#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to invite collaborators to the IBM Quantum Platform account for your "
"organization, and manage their access"
msgstr ""
"Cara menjemput rakan kerja ke akaun IBM Quantum Platform organisasi anda, "
"dan mengurus akses mereka"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Invite users and manage their access"
msgstr "Jemput pengguna dan urus akses mereka"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Invite users and manage their access {#invite-users-and-manage-their-access}"
msgstr ""
"Jemput pengguna dan urus akses mereka {#invite-users-and-manage-their-"
"access}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Before you begin\">\n"
"Create your account's instances before you invite users. For every instance you create through IBM Quantum Platform, an associated [access group](/guides/access-groups) is automatically generated. When you invite users to an instance, you can assign them to a specific instance's access group as part of the invitation process.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Sebelum anda mula\">\n"
"Cipta instans akaun anda sebelum menjemput pengguna. Bagi setiap instans yang anda cipta melalui IBM Quantum Platform, satu [kumpulan akses](/guides/access-groups) yang berkaitan akan dijana secara automatik. Apabila anda menjemput pengguna ke sesuatu instans, anda boleh menetapkan mereka kepada kumpulan akses instans tertentu semasa proses jemputan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"invite\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"invite\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Invite users to your organization's account {#invite-users-to-your-"
"organizations-account}"
msgstr ""
"Jemput pengguna ke akaun organisasi anda {#invite-users-to-your-"
"organizations-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition note=\"tip\" title=\"Users with IBM Cloud accounts\">\n"
"If a user has a previously existing IBM Cloud account, follow the instructions in the [Manage IBM Cloud users](/guides/manage-cloud-users) section.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition note=\"tip\" title=\"Pengguna dengan akaun IBM Cloud\">\n"
"Jika pengguna mempunyai akaun IBM Cloud sedia ada, ikuti arahan dalam bahagian [Urus pengguna IBM Cloud](/guides/manage-cloud-users).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, ensure you have the correct account and region selected in the "
"account and region switchers in the header.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mula-mula, pastikan anda telah memilih akaun dan rantau yang betul dalam "
"pemilih akaun dan rantau di pengepala.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Select [*Access management*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) from the "
"main menu.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilih [*Pengurusan akses*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) daripada "
"menu utama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "On the Users tab, click  \"Invite user\".\n"
msgstr "Pada tab Pengguna, klik \"Jemput pengguna\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter the users' email addresses and optionally assign the invited users to "
"access groups.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masukkan alamat e-mel pengguna dan secara pilihan tetapkan pengguna yang "
"dijemput kepada kumpulan akses.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The user will receive an invitation to create an IBM Cloud account and join "
"the instance. After they accept the invitation, they will see a new account "
"in their account switcher at the top of the IBM Quantum Platform page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna akan menerima jemputan untuk mencipta akaun IBM Cloud dan menyertai"
" instans. Selepas mereka menerima jemputan, mereka akan melihat akaun baharu"
" dalam pemilih akaun di bahagian atas halaman IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Manage a user's access groups {#manage-a-users-access-groups}"
msgstr "Urus kumpulan akses pengguna {#manage-a-users-access-groups}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To change a user's access groups, go to [*Access "
"management*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) from the main menu. Click "
"the overflow menu at the end of the user's row and select *Manage access*. "
"On the modal that opens, select the access groups the user should belong "
"to.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengubah kumpulan akses pengguna, pergi ke [*Pengurusan "
"akses*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) daripada menu utama. Klik menu "
"limpahan di hujung baris pengguna dan pilih *Urus akses*. Pada modal yang "
"terbuka, pilih kumpulan akses yang patut disertai oleh pengguna tersebut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Remove a user {#remove-a-user}"
msgstr "Buang pengguna {#remove-a-user}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To remove a user from an instance, go to [*Access "
"management*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) from the main menu. Click "
"the overflow menu at the end of the user's row, and select *Delete*. You are"
" prompted to confirm the deletion.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk membuang pengguna daripada sesuatu instans, pergi ke [*Pengurusan "
"akses*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) daripada menu utama. Klik menu "
"limpahan di hujung baris pengguna, dan pilih *Padam*. Anda akan diminta "
"untuk mengesahkan pemadaman.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"If a user is removed from an instance, their workloads and the associated results are no longer visible to them. Other users in the same instance can still access the workload data and results.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Jika pengguna dibuang daripada instans, beban kerja mereka dan keputusan yang berkaitan tidak lagi kelihatan kepada mereka. Pengguna lain dalam instans yang sama masih boleh mengakses data beban kerja dan keputusan tersebut.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   - Create [instances](/guides/instances#add-instance).\n"
"   - Understand the [IBM Cloud account structure](/guides/cloud-account-structure), including access policies, groups, and roles.\n"
"   - [Create and manage access groups](/guides/access-groups).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"   - Cipta [instans.](/guides/instances#add-instance)\n"
"   - Fahami [struktur akaun IBM Cloud,](/guides/cloud-account-structure) termasuk dasar akses, kumpulan, dan peranan.\n"
"   - [Cipta dan urus kumpulan akses.](/guides/access-groups)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
